{"claims":[{"claim_text":"The Libertarian Socialist Caucus seeks to provide a political home within the Democratic Socialists of America for all socialists who are opposed to the state.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"The Libertarian Socialist Caucus is composed of libertarian socialists, libertarian Marxists, anarchists, left communists, and adherents to other schools of thought within the left wing of the socialist movement.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"The Libertarian Socialist Caucus strives to build an equitable, democratic and open society.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"The Libertarian Socialist Caucus believes that an equitable, democratic and open society cannot be achieved if their organization is hierarchical, bureaucratic, and opaque in its function.", "claim_types":["evaluation"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"The Libertarian Socialist Caucus has come together within DSA to preserve and advance those tendencies which harmonize with their vision of socialist means and ends.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"The Libertarian Socialist Caucus has come together within DSA to create a point of contact and organizing between their faction and the broader socialist movement.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Anarchist and libertarian socialist thought, since as early as the late 19th and early 20th centuries, has stressed that enacting their vision of society requires embodying and exemplifying that vision.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"The Industrial Workers of the World (IWW) stated that one must “build the new world in the shell of the old”.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"The points of unity establish the basis for the program and platform of the Libertarian Socialist Caucus as well as the goals, methods, and strategies by which they plan to achieve them.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[3]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
